  "format_data": null,
  "html": "<html>\n    <head>\n        <style>\n            /* Estilos para el formato de impresión */\n            @page {\n                size: A4 landscape; /* Orientación horizontal */\n                margin: 5mm;\n            }\n\n            /* html, body {\n                width: 297mm;\n                height: 210mm;\n                margin: 0;\n                padding: 0;\n                font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n                font-size: 10px;\n            } */\n\n            .mb-7 {\n                margin-bottom: -7px !important;\n            }\n\n            .mt-7 {\n                margin-top: -7px !important;\n            }\n\n            .text-right {\n                text-align: right;\n            }\n\n            .text-center {\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n\n            tr > th {\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: 12px;\n            }\n\n            /* Estilos generales de la tabla para el diseño de columnas */\n            .withholding-voucher-info {\n                width: 100%;\n                border-collapse: separate;\n                border-spacing: 0;\n            }\n\n            /* Estilos generales de la tabla para el diseño de columnas */\n            .withholding-voucher-table, .withholding-voucher-details-table {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 auto; \n                border-collapse: separate;\n                border-spacing: 0;\n                margin-top: 5px;\n            }\n            \n            /* Estilos para las celdas de la tabla */\n            .withholding-voucher-table td {\n                padding-top: 0px;\n                vertical-align: top;\n                border: 1px solid #000;\n            }\n\n            /* Forzar la negrita */\n            b, strong, h6 {\n                font-weight: bold !important;\n            }\n\n            .withholding-voucher-details-table td, .withholding-voucher-details-table th {\n                border-top: 1px solid #000;\n                border-bottom: 1px solid #000;\n            }\n\n            .withholding-voucher-details-table tr.totales td {\n                border-bottom: none !important;\n            }\n\n            .withholding-voucher-details-table tr.header td {\n                border-top: none !important;\n            }\n        </style>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n        <div class=\"withholding-voucher-container\" style=\"width: 90%; margin: 0 auto;\">\n            <div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n                <h1> COMPROBANTE DE RETENCION DEL IMPUESTO AL VALOR AGREGADO </h1>\n            </div>\n\n            <table class=\"withholding-voucher-table\" >\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            <p class=\"mt-7\"> Decreto con Rango, Valor y Fuerza de Ley de Reforma de la Ley del Impuesto al Valor Agregado N° 1.436 del 17 de Noviembre de 2014 </p>\n                            <p class=\"mb-7\">\n                                Articulo 11: \"La Administración Tributaria podrá designar como responsables del pago del impuesto, en calidad de agentes de retención,  </br>\n                                a quienes por funciones públicas o por razón de sus actividades privadas intervengan en operaciones con el impuesto establecido en este  </br>\n                                Decreto con Rango, Valor y Fuerza de ley. (...)\"  \n                            </p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n\n            <table class=\"withholding-voucher-table\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mt-7\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">NOMBRE O RAZON SOCIAL DEL AGENTE DE RETENCION </h6>\n                            <p class=\"mb-7\">{{ doc.empresa }}</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"width: 30%;\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mt-7\" style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\">REGISTRO DE INFORMACION FISCAL </br> DEL AGENTE DE RETENCION (R.I.F) </h6>\n                            <p class=\"mb-7\"> {{ frappe.db.get_value(\"Company\", doc.company, \"tax_id\") }} </p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"width: 20%;\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mt-7\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Nº COMPROBANTE:</h6>\n                            <p class=\"mb-7\">{{ doc.voucher_number }}</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n\n            <table class=\"withholding-voucher-table\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"width: 70%;\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mt-7\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">DIRECCION FISCAL DEL AGENTE DE RETENCION </h6>\n                            <p class=\"mb-7\">{{ doc.company_address }}</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"width: 10%;\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mt-7\" class=\"mb-7\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">FECHA DE </br> EMISION</h6>\n                            <p class=\"mb-7\">{{ frappe.utils.getdate(doc.issue_date).strftime('%d/%m/%Y') }}</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"width: 10%;\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mt-7\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">FECHA DE </br> ENTREGA</h6>\n                            <p class=\"mb-7\">{{ frappe.utils.getdate(doc.delivery_date).strftime('%d/%m/%Y') }}</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n\n                    <table class=\"withholding-voucher-table\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mt-7\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">NOMBRE O RAZON SOCIAL DEL CONTRIBUYENTE</h6>\n                            <p class=\"mb-7\">{{ doc.supplier }}</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"width: 30%;\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mt-7\" style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\">REGISTRO DE INFORMACION FISCAL </br> DEL CONTRIBUYENTE (R.I.F) </h6>\n                            <p class=\"mb-7\"> {{ frappe.db.get_value(\"Supplier\", doc.supplier, \"tax_id\") }} </p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"width: 20%;\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mt-7\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">PERIODO FISCAL:</h6>\n                            <p class=\"mb-7\">{{ doc.fiscal_period }}</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n\n            <table class=\"withholding-voucher-table\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"width: 80%;\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mt-7\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">DIRECCION FISCAL DEL CONTRIBUYENTE </h6>\n                            <p class=\"mb-7\">{{ doc.supplier_address }}</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"width: 20%; border: none !important;\">\n                            <!-- <h6 style=\"font-weight: bold;\">REGISTRO DE INFORMACION FISCAL </br> DEL CONTRIBUYENTE (R.I.F)</h6>\n                            <p>{{ doc.supplier_rif }}</p> -->\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"withholding-voucher-details\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n            <table class=\"withholding-voucher-details-table\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; \">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr class=\"header\">\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td class=\"text-center\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000 !important;\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mt-7 mb-7\"> Compras Internas </br> ó Importaciones </h6> \n                        </td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th style=\"font-weight: bold; width: 10%;\">Fecha </br> Factura</th>\n                        <th style=\"font-weight: bold; width: 10%;\">Nº Factura</th>\n                        <th style=\"font-weight: bold; width: 10%;\">Nº Control</th>\n                        <th style=\"font-weight: bold; width: 5%;\">N/D</th>\n                        <th style=\"font-weight: bold; width: 5%;\">N/C</th>\n                        <th style=\"font-weight: bold; width: 5%;\">Factura </br> Afectada</th>\n                        <th style=\"font-weight: bold; width: 10%;\">Total Compras </br> + IVA</th>\n                        <th style=\"font-weight: bold; width: 10%;\">Compras sin </br> credito fiscal</th>\n                        <th style=\"font-weight: bold; width: 10%;\">Base </br> Imponible</th>\n                        <th style=\"font-weight: bold; width: 5%;\">% Alicuota</th>\n                        <th style=\"font-weight: bold; width: 10%;\">IVA</th>\n                        <th style=\"font-weight: bold; width: 10%;\">IVA Retenido</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    {% for item in doc.vat_withholding_voucher_item %}\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"text-center\">{{ frappe.utils.getdate(item.posting_date).strftime('%d/%m/%Y') }}</td>\n                        <td class=\"text-center\">{{ item.bill_no }}</td>\n                        <td class=\"text-center\">{{ item.bill_control }}</td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td class=\"text-right\">{{ '{:.2f}'.format(item.grand_total) }}</td>\n                        <td class=\"text-right\">{{ '{:.2f}'.format(item.purchases_without_tax_credit) }}</td>\n                        <td class=\"text-right\">{{ '{:.2f}'.format(item.total) }}</td>\n                        <td>{{ '{:.2f}'.format(item.rate) }}</td>\n                        <td class=\"text-right\">{{ '{:.2f}'.format(item.taxes_and_charges_added) }}</td>\n                        <td class=\"text-right\">{{ '{:.2f}'.format(item.taxes_and_charges_deducted) }}</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    {% endfor %}\n                    <tr class=\"totales\">\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td>Totales:</td>\n                        <td class=\"text-right\">{{ '{:.2f}'.format(doc.totals_grand_total) }}</td>\n                        <td class=\"text-right\">{{ '{:.2f}'.format(doc.totals_purchases_without_tax_credit) }}</td>\n                        <td class=\"text-right\">{{ '{:.2f}'.format(doc.totals_total) }}</td>\n                        <td class=\"text-right\"></td>\n                        <td class=\"text-right\">{{ '{:.2f}'.format(doc.totals_taxes_and_charges_added) }}</td>\n                        <td class=\"text-right\">{{ '{:.2f}'.format(doc.totals_taxes_and_charges_deducted) }}</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"withholding-voucher-details\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n            <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; margin-top: 20px;\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; padding-right: 20px;\">\n                            <hr style=\"border-top: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 5px; width: 200px;\">\n                            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px;\">Agente de Retención </br> (Sello, Firma y Fecha)</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 20px;\">\n                            <hr style=\"border-top: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 5px; width: 200px;\">\n                            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px;\">Sujeto Retenido </br> (Sello, Firma y Fecha)</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;\">\n                <small>Este comprobante se emitio según lo establecido en el Articulo N° 16 de la Providencia Administrativa SNAT/2015/0049 en fecha 14/07/2015 Publicada en Gaceta Oficial N° 40.720 en fecha 10/08/2015 </small>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </body>\n</html>",
